  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This is quite minor and frankly, I will be fine if this is disregarded (especially since we can fix this ourselves outlined in https://docs.vrchat.com/v2022.1.1/docs/osc-avatar-parameters), but the older version of TouchOSC MK1 does not support Booleans as an output value, instead the editor interprets it as a integer. I was having issues until I realized this was the case. To save possible frustrations on the end user, possibly consider this or provide a in-game way of changing the OSC config for the avatar.",
